SUMMARY:Santa's Trolley
DESCRIPTION:Join Holly the Elf on a holiday trolley adventure through downtown Raleigh! \nSanta is lost in Raleigh\, and Holly the Elf needs your help to find him! Join Holly aboard the Historic Raleigh Trolley to help track down Santa in time for Christmas. Arrive up to 30 minutes early or stay after your tour to make a s’more! Tours leave at 5:00 pm\, 6:00 pm\, and 7:00 pm from Mordecai Historic Park at 1 Mimosa Street in Raleigh. Advanced registration is required. To purchase tickets\, visit reclink.raleighnc.gov and select “Tours.”
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/santas-trolley/2026-12-13/
LOCATION:Mordecai Historic Park\, 1 Mimosa Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27604\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Mordecai-Holiday-Trolly-17-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
